/-- The `n`-th iterated derivative of a function from `𝕜` to `F`, as a function from `𝕜` to `F`. -/
def iteratedDeriv (n : ℕ) (f : 𝕜 → F) (x : 𝕜) : F :=
  (iteratedFDeriv 𝕜 n f x : (Fin n → 𝕜) → F) fun _ : Fin n => 1

